{# Outlook renders with the Word engine: tables for layout, inline styles only.
   No flexbox, no grid, no border-radius, no box-shadow, no <style> block and no
   external stylesheet — all of those are ignored or stripped. Inline styles on
   cells are not optional here, they are the only mechanism that works.

   WIDTH. Every table declares the same width as an HTML attribute *and* as a
   style. The attribute is what the Word engine honours; with only the CSS, each
   block collapsed to its own content width and a real email went out with the
   EQUIPO card narrow and the alarm card wide.

   PALETTE, from the Emeltec brand manual:
     brand           PANTONE 7707C        #005f7f   principal, in settings.yaml
     rule / soft     PANTONE COOL GRAY 7C #98989a   companion, as tints
   Cool Gray appears as a light tint for the rules and a dark one for small text,
   not at full strength: on white it gives about 3:1 of contrast, under the 4.5:1
   that small text needs to stay readable.

   The severity colours are NOT brand colours. Red and amber for alarm levels are
   a universal convention and the manual defines no severity palette, so they live
   apart from `brand` to make clear they signal a level, not an identity.

   Every colour is declared below. None is buried further down the file. #}
{% set critical_color = '#c00000' %}
{% set panel_color = '#4a4a4c' %}
{% set action_color = '#1e6b34' %}
{% set action_bg = '#f5faf6' %}
{% set urgent_color = '#a85400' %}
{% set accent = critical_color if critical else (urgent_color if urgent else brand) %}
{% set rule = '#d9d9db' %}
{% set tint = '#fafafa' %}
{% set soft = '#6b6b6d' %}
{% set width = 660 %}
<div style="font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #202020;">
{% if missing_phrases %}
  {# A safety alarm is never delayed over a dictionary gap, so this draft may
     carry English. The banner has to be removed by hand before sending, which
     makes it impossible to miss. #}
  <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="{{ width }}"
         style="border-collapse: collapse; width: {{ width }}px; max-width: 100%; margin: 0 0 24px 0;">
    <tr>
      <td style="background-color: #c00000; color: #ffffff; padding: 14px 18px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5;">
        <strong>NO ENVIAR ASÍ — FALTA TRADUCIR</strong><br>
        Este borrador contiene texto en inglés porque el glosario no cubre
        {{ missing_phrases|length }} frase{{ 's' if missing_phrases|length > 1 else '' }}:
        <ul style="margin: 8px 0 8px 20px; padding: 0;">
{% for phrase in missing_phrases %}
          <li style="margin: 0 0 4px 0;">{{ phrase }}</li>
{% endfor %}
        </ul>
        Traducila, agregala a <code>config\glossary.yaml</code>, y borrá este
        aviso antes de enviar.
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
{% endif %}

  <p style="margin: 0 0 14px 0;">{{ greeting }} {{ client_name }},</p>

{% if critical %}
  <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
    Junto con saludar, informamos que hemos registrado
    <strong>{{ summary.count }} alarmas en el mismo equipo durante el mismo día</strong>,
    lo que indica una condición que está evolucionando. Recomendamos verificación
    en terreno a la brevedad.
  </p>
{% elif summary.repeated %}
  <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
    Junto con saludar, hemos revisado el reporte de alarmas generado por sus
    equipos y detectamos <strong>{{ summary.count }} alarmas reiteradas en un
    mismo equipo</strong>. La repetición sugiere una condición persistente que
    requiere atención y verificación en terreno.
  </p>
{% elif urgent %}
  <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
    Junto con saludar, hemos revisado el reporte de alarmas generado por sus
    equipos y detectamos un evento clasificado como urgente, que requiere
    atención y verificación en terreno.
  </p>
{% else %}
  <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
    Junto con saludar, hemos revisado el reporte de alarmas generado por el
    sistema de monitoreo en sus equipos y le informamos el siguiente evento, con
    el detalle de la condición detectada y la acción recomendada.
  </p>
{% endif %}

{% if already_reported %}
  {# Explains the severity without resending what the client already got. #}
  <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="{{ width }}"
         style="border-collapse: collapse; width: {{ width }}px; max-width: 100%; margin: 0 0 20px 0;">
    <tr>
      <td style="border-left: 4px solid {{ accent }}; background-color: #f7f7f7;
                 padding: 12px 16px; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 1.5;">
        Este equipo acumula <strong>{{ summary.count }} alarmas</strong> desde el
        {{ first_date }}.
        {% if already_reported == 1 %}
          La primera ya fue informada;
        {% else %}
          Las {{ already_reported }} anteriores ya fueron informadas;
        {% endif %}
        a continuación el detalle de
        {% if new_count == 1 %}la nueva{% else %}las {{ new_count }} nuevas{% endif %}.
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
{% endif %}

  <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="{{ width }}"
         style="border-collapse: collapse; width: {{ width }}px; max-width: 100%; margin: 0 0 22px 0;">
    <tr>
      <td colspan="2" style="background-color: {{ brand }}; color: #ffffff; padding: 10px 16px;
                             font-size: 9.5pt; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px;">
        EQUIPO
      </td>
    </tr>
{% for label, value in identification %}
    <tr>
      <td width="170" style="border: 1px solid {{ rule }}; border-top: none; padding: 11px 16px;
                 background-color: {{ tint }}; font-size: 10pt; width: 170px;
                 color: {{ soft }}; vertical-align: top;">{{ label }}</td>
      <td style="border: 1px solid {{ rule }}; border-top: none; border-left: none;
                 padding: 11px 16px; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: top;">{{ value }}</td>
    </tr>
{% endfor %}
  </table>

  <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="{{ width }}"
         style="border-collapse: collapse; width: {{ width }}px; max-width: 100%; margin: 0 0 22px 0;">
    <tr>
      <td colspan="3" style="background-color: {{ accent }}; color: #ffffff; padding: 10px 16px;
                             font-size: 9.5pt; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px;">
{% if already_reported %}
        {{ new_count }} ALARMA{{ 'S' if new_count > 1 else '' }} NUEVA{{ 'S' if new_count > 1 else '' }}
{% else %}
        {{ summary.count }} ALARMA{{ 'S' if summary.count > 1 else '' }} · {{ period }}
{% endif %}
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td width="150" style="border: 1px solid {{ rule }}; border-top: none; padding: 8px 16px;
                 background-color: {{ tint }}; font-size: 8.5pt; letter-spacing: 0.5px;
                 color: {{ soft }}; width: 150px;">FECHA</td>
      <td width="200" style="border: 1px solid {{ rule }}; border-top: none; border-left: none;
                 padding: 8px 16px; background-color: {{ tint }}; font-size: 8.5pt;
                 letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: {{ soft }}; width: 200px;">TIPO</td>
      <td style="border: 1px solid {{ rule }}; border-top: none; border-left: none;
                 padding: 8px 16px; background-color: {{ tint }}; font-size: 8.5pt;
                 letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: {{ soft }};">URGENCIA SEGÚN EL REPORTE</td>
    </tr>
{% for item in timeline %}
    <tr>
      <td style="border: 1px solid {{ rule }}; border-top: none; padding: 11px 16px;
                 font-size: 10pt; white-space: nowrap; vertical-align: top;">{{ item.date }}</td>
      <td style="border: 1px solid {{ rule }}; border-top: none; border-left: none;
                 padding: 11px 16px; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: top;">{{ item.event_type }}</td>
      <td style="border: 1px solid {{ rule }}; border-top: none; border-left: none;
                 padding: 11px 16px; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: top;">{{ item.urgency }}</td>
    </tr>
{% endfor %}
  </table>

{# One block per distinct condition, not one per alarm and not only the latest.
   A machine repeating the same looseness three times gets that condition once
   with its three dates; a machine reporting looseness and then a bearing gets
   two blocks. Showing only the latest used to hide the earlier condition
   entirely whenever the failures differed. #}
{% if details|length > 1 %}
  <p style="margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-size: 10pt; color: {{ soft }};">
    Se detectaron <strong>{{ details|length }} condiciones distintas</strong> en
    este equipo. El detalle de cada una:
  </p>
{% endif %}
{% for detail in details %}
  <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="{{ width }}"
         style="border-collapse: collapse; width: {{ width }}px; max-width: 100%; margin: 0 0 22px 0;">
    <tr>
      <td style="background-color: {{ brand }}; color: #ffffff; padding: 10px 16px;
                 font-size: 9.5pt; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px;">
        QUÉ INDICA EL MONITOREO
{% if details|length > 1 or detail.count > 1 %}
        · {{ detail.event_type|upper }}
{% endif %}
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="border: 1px solid {{ rule }}; border-top: none; padding: 8px 16px;
                 background-color: {{ tint }}; font-size: 9pt; color: {{ soft }};">
{% if detail.count > 1 %}
        {{ detail.count }} alarmas · {{ detail.when }}
{% else %}
        {{ detail.when }}
{% endif %}
      </td>
    </tr>
{% if detail.equipment_status %}
    <tr>
      <td style="border: 1px solid {{ rule }}; border-top: none; padding: 13px 16px;
                 font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.6;">
        <strong style="color: {{ soft }};">Estado del equipo</strong><br>
        {{ detail.equipment_status }}
      </td>
    </tr>
{% endif %}
{% if detail.possible_cause %}
    <tr>
      <td style="border: 1px solid {{ rule }}; border-top: none; padding: 13px 16px;
                 font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.6;">
        <strong style="color: {{ soft }};">Causa probable</strong><br>
        {{ detail.possible_cause }}
      </td>
    </tr>
{% endif %}
{% if detail.recommended_action %}
    <tr>
      <td style="border: 1px solid {{ rule }}; border-top: none;
                 border-left: 4px solid {{ action_color }}; padding: 13px 16px;
                 font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.6; background-color: {{ action_bg }};">
        <strong style="color: {{ action_color }};">Acción recomendada por el monitoreo</strong><br>
        {{ detail.recommended_action }}
      </td>
    </tr>
{% endif %}
  </table>
{% endfor %}

{% if emeltec_note %}
  <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="{{ width }}"
         style="border-collapse: collapse; width: {{ width }}px; max-width: 100%; margin: 0 0 22px 0;">
    <tr>
      <td style="background-color: {{ panel_color }}; color: #ffffff; padding: 10px 16px;
                 font-size: 9.5pt; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px;">
        RECOMENDACIÓN DE EMELTEC
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="border: 1px solid {{ rule }}; border-top: none; padding: 16px;
                 font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.6;">
        [COMPLETAR]
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
{% endif %}

  <p style="margin: 0 0 14px 0;">Quedamos atentos a sus comentarios.</p>

  <p style="margin: 0;">Saludos cordiales,</p>
</div>
